          "range": "60 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "Basic will",
          "description": "<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also Stunned 1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "7guxVIDNy4rgjpZZ"
        },
        {
          "name": "Shield",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "force"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1",
          "duration": "until the start of your next turn",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the Shield Block reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. You can use the spell's reaction to reduce damage from any spell or magical effect, even if it doesn't deal physical damage. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The shield's Hardness increases by 5.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "yxoVpTNX6FjwmgFx"
        },
        {
          "name": "Telekinetic Projectile",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "QJQwvXHWmVgHTRnm"
        },
        {
          "name": "Void Warp",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 0,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "void"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 living creature",
          "save": "Basic fortitude",
          "description": "<p>You call upon the Void to harm life force. The target takes 2d4 void damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target is also Enfeebled 1 until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "6vcYb4HncqlsvCEc"
        }
      ],
      "lv1spells": [
        {
          "name": "Command",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 1,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "auditory",
            "concentrate",
            "linguistic",
            "manipulate",
            "mental"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "until the end of the target's next turn",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "will",
          "description": "<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the Fleeing condition), release what it's holding, drop Prone, or stand in place. It can't Delay or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "WceTHgJ6Ch7Nx3MM"
        },
        {
          "name": "Fear",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 1,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "emotion",
            "fear",
            "manipulate",
            "mental"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "varies",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "will",
          "description": "<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Frightened 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Frightened 3 and Fleeing for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "VRyJ0ArnB61EKSef"
        },
        {
          "name": "Grim Tendrils",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 1,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "void"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "",
          "area": "30ft line",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "fortitude",
          "description": "<p>Tendrils of darkness curl out from your fingertips and race through the air. You deal 2d4 void damage and (@item.level) Bleed Damage damage to living creatures in the line. Each living creature in the line must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half the void damage and no persistent bleed damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double void damage and double persistent bleed damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The void damage increases by 2d4, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "A045ypFn4rYKh18q"
        }
